  "description": "Strength • Quality • Travel • Build • Geometry • Build Kits • Technical Specs\n\nThe Tetra Tandem finds its roots in the first carbon tandem to ever roll out of Craig Calfee’s shop. Tetra’s carbon tubing is unmatched in terms of durability and strength, favoring an intermediate modulus carbon to achieve a robustness suitable for traveling, bike-packing, or whatever you have to throw at it.\n\nOur wrapped lug design provides a level of comfort and compliance that procures an astounding ride quality that few other bikes can deliver. Through more than 30 years of research, development, and advancements in the carbon bicycle industry, we’ve refined our unique manufacturing process to develop the perfect tailored ride for every tandem team.\n\nOur expert-selected build kits utilize your favorite components from the likes of SRAM, Shimano, Campagnolo, and more to deliver a well rounded package while eliminating the guess work related to tandem construction and specifications. Each unique build kit is thoroughly tested to ensure maximum reliability and performance. See available build kits for this model.\n\nCustom engineered had-shell traveling cases to protect and pack your tandem. Travel case come fitted with tube protective wrapping to fit your specific tandem, custom fork mount, wheel bag, frame mounting points. Have peace-of-mind that tandem is safe and secure during travel!",
